  <ifrs-full:DisclosureOfFairValueMeasurementOfAssetsExplanatory contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">(4) 가치평가기법 및 투입변수									

